m/apps/2746510/extras/64a885a617edd5c80c9ce9f7821650eb.mp4?t=1705942010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Learning While Playing</strong><br><br><i>The Social Engineer</i> is a Serious Game based on typical cases in real Social Engineering security audits. It can be used for training to understand Social Engineering attacks and increase awareness of Social Engineering in both private and professional settings. The game concept was developed in collaboration with an IT security firm and scientifically accompanied. The special Educational Mode allows querying learned knowledge directly in the game.<br><br><br><strong>Safety Guidelines</strong><br><br>This game includes fast movements and on-screen text that may cause discomfort or eye strain in a few individuals. Take a break if you feel uneasy or experience symptoms of motion sickness, simulator sickness, or eye strain!<br><br>All locations, company names, logos, and individuals in the game are fictional. Similarities to real places, companies, or persons are unintended and purely coincidental. All Social Engineering attacks presented in the game are merely gameplay mechanics and should only be carried out in the real world by trained security experts.<br><br><strong>About the Developers</strong><br><br>We are <i>zefwih</i>, a small development studio from Germany. Although we may not compete with major providers, we develop all our games with attention to detail and great care. If you have suggestions, issues, praise, or feedback, feel free to reach out to us!",
